	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Keyword rsc lists Raycast script commands from the folders in Configure Workflow (colon-separated, default ~/raycast-scripts). Inline commands show a cached line and refresh in the background. Return on an inline command refreshes it and reopens rsc. Return on silent or compact posts the last line. Return on full output shows Large Type.</string>
